4. **HIGH severity bugs from `QA_REPORT.md` (2026-05-14) — re-verified 2026-06-11 against current code:**
   - H-01: **Still open.** `app/api/admin/consultations/route.ts` GET still has no `.range()`/pagination — confirmed by direct read.
   - H-02: **Still open.** `app/api/used-listings/route.ts:61` still reads `if (!mileage && mileage !== 0)` — negative mileage passes validation.
