10. `MIGRATIONS_TO_APPLY.md`, `PENDING_MIGRATIONS.sql`, and `supabase/manual/*.sql` are three overlapping, partially-redundant sources of migration truth — needs consolidation into `supabase/migrations/` only.

### 2.3 Process gaps (the actual subject of this charter)
11. No SDLC framework defined — see Section 3.
12. No team / ownership model — every feature was built by one AI-assisted developer session; no code review, no second reviewer.
13. No licensing, IP assignment, or confidentiality policy on file — see Section 6.
14. No environment separation documented (dev/staging/prod) — only `.env.local` referenced.
15. No incident response or rollback procedure for bad deploys/migrations.

