## 4. Team Structure & Role Assignments

Since the Investor has asked the PM to "hire" and assign work, the following is the **recommended team structure** for EVGuide at its current stage. These are roles the PM will operate *as* (via specialized AI agent delegation where the tooling supports it) until the Investor chooses to hire human equivalents.

| Role | Responsibility | Current Assignee | Priority Tasks (see §5) |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Project Manager** (this role) | Roadmap, prioritization, risk tracking, investor reporting, release approval gate-keeping | Claude (PM persona) | Maintain this file, run weekly status review |
| **Tech Lead / Architect** | Schema design, migration consolidation, API contract consistency, code review | Claude (Tech Lead persona) | Consolidate migration files (Item 2.3 #10) |
| **Backend / API Engineer** | Fix HIGH/MEDIUM bugs, harden API validation, pagination | Claude (Backend persona) | H-01 through H-04, M-01–M-06 |
| **QA / Test Engineer** | Build automated test suite, re-run QA sweeps, regression testing | **Unassigned — recommend hiring or dedicating sessions** | Stand up Playwright E2E + Vitest unit suite |
| **DevOps Engineer** | CI/CD pipeline (GitHub Actions), environment separation, Sentry integration | **Unassigned — recommend hiring** | Build `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (lint + build on PR) |
| **Database Administrator** | Apply `PENDING_MIGRATIONS.sql`, manage Supabase access tokens, backup policy | **Investor (only one with dashboard access)** | Apply pending migration (blocking item 2.1 #1) |
| **Security Reviewer** | Periodic dependency audit (`npm audit`), RLS policy review, pen-test scheduling | **Unassigned — recommend quarterly external review** | First `npm audit` pass |
| **Frontend / UX** | Admin pagination, bulk actions, CSV export, accessibility pass | Claude (Frontend persona) | Roadmap Phase 2 items |

> **PM's recommendation to Investor:** the two roles that genuinely need a human (not AI-delegated) are **Database Administrator** (Supabase dashboard access / billing) and, eventually, **QA Engineer** for independent verification before public launch. Everything else can continue as AI-assisted Claude personas under PM coordination, but a second human reviewer is strongly advised before handling real customer payment or PII data at scale.

